<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong forex association changes name.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong forex association changes name.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Forex Association has officially changed its name to the Hong Kong Financial Markets Association, the group said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The change was made to better reflect the diversification of the nature of business among the group's members, the association said.</p>
<p>The name change also follows a move last year by the international foreign exchange body, the Association Cambiste Internationale (ACI), to change its name to ACI-Financial Markets Association.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
